---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="What's Your Curriculum? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's educational philosophy, curriculum approach, and how we prepare children for kindergarten.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/girl_reading_book_quiet_corner_background.jpg" 
        alt="Curriculum" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">What's Marietta Childcare's Curriculum?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Educational philosophy and curriculum approach designed to prepare children for kindergarten and beyond.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare's curriculum is designed to nurture little minds and grow big hearts. Marietta Childcare's educational approach prepares children cognitively, socially, and emotionally for kindergarten and beyond.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Educational Philosophy</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's educational philosophy emphasizes holistic child development. Marietta Childcare believes that quality early childhood education supports children's cognitive growth, social skills, and emotional resilience. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare reflects research-based practices in early childhood development.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's approach creates a home away from home environment where children feel safe and valued. Marietta Childcare's staff nurtures children's natural curiosity and love of learning. The learning environment at Marietta Childcare supports each child's individual developmental pace and learning style.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Global Awareness and Service Learning</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare emphasizes global awareness and service learning throughout the curriculum. Marietta Childcare teaches children invaluable lessons about interconnectedness and community responsibility. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare includes activities that help children understand diverse cultures and perspectives.</p>
          <p>Service learning at Marietta Childcare develops children's empathy and social consciousness. Marietta Childcare's service projects teach children about helping others and contributing to their community. Marietta Childcare's global curriculum prepares children to be thoughtful, engaged citizens.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Age-Specific Learning Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers age-specific programs tailored to developmental stages. Infant programs at Marietta Childcare focus on sensory exploration and secure attachment. Toddler programs at Marietta Childcare emphasize language development and motor skill growth.</p>
          <p>Preschool programs at Marietta Childcare build pre-academic skills including letter recognition, number concepts, and early literacy. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare for preschoolers includes science exploration, creative arts, and social-emotional learning. Marietta Childcare's programs prepare children for kindergarten readiness.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Learning Areas and Activities</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's classrooms include diverse learning centers. Marietta Childcare provides literacy centers, math manipulatives, science exploration areas, and creative arts stations. The learning environment at Marietta Childcare encourages hands-on discovery and experiential learning.</p>
          <p>Outdoor play at Marietta Childcare supports physical development and nature exploration. Marietta Childcare's outdoor curriculum includes gross motor activities, gardening, and environmental learning. Marietta Childcare's balanced approach combines structured activities with child-directed play.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Social-Emotional Development</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare prioritizes social-emotional learning as a core curriculum component. Marietta Childcare teaches children emotional regulation, conflict resolution, and empathy. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare helps children develop healthy relationships and self-awareness.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff models positive social behaviors and guides children through social challenges. Marietta Childcare's approach builds children's confidence and resilience. The social-emotional curriculum at Marietta Childcare supports children's mental health and well-being.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Kindergarten Readiness</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's curriculum explicitly prepares children for kindergarten transition. Marietta Childcare focuses on academic readiness including letter and number recognition, phonemic awareness, and early writing skills. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare also develops executive function skills like attention, memory, and self-control.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's kindergarten readiness program includes practice with classroom routines and expectations. Marietta Childcare's transition support helps children develop confidence for the kindergarten environment. Marietta Childcare provides resources to families about kindergarten preparation.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Specialized Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers specialized enrichment programs beyond the core curriculum. Marietta Childcare provides music, arts, and movement activities. Specialized programs at Marietta Childcare may include STEM learning, language development, and sports activities.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrichment programs support diverse learning interests and talents. Marietta Childcare's specialized offerings enhance the core curriculum and provide varied learning experiences. Families should ask about specialized programs available at the Marietta location.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Inclusive Learning Environment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare creates an inclusive learning environment for all children. Marietta Childcare's curriculum accommodates diverse learning needs and abilities. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare celebrates differences and promotes acceptance.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare works with families to support children with special needs. Marietta Childcare's staff receives training in inclusive practices. Marietta Childcare's commitment to inclusion ensures all children feel valued and supported.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Learn More About Our Curriculum</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to observe classrooms and learn about the curriculum firsthand. Schedule a tour at Marietta Childcare to see the learning environment and meet the educators who implement the curriculum.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/teacher-qualifications" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What Are Your Teacher Qualifications?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/transition-to-kindergarten" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Prepare for Kindergarten?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/premium-enrichment" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Premium Enrichment Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
